the same batch is counted in \code{n_conspecific} but never corroborates -- the
motivating true mislabel \code{MN883227} (\emph{Fundulus luciae}, actually a Pacific
\emph{Fundulus}) has a same-day sibling \code{MN883226} at 100\% that must not rescue
it.
